  {
    "type": "table",
    "entries": [
      {
        "text": "You are playing as a paper plane. Move around the board to aim your weapon at enemies.",
        "image": "images/folds1.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Enemies move down the board and have different behaviors, memorize these patterns to predict where you will be safe.",
        "image": "images/folds2.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Basic enemies will drop blue crystals, collect these to unlock powerups.",
        "image": "images/folds3.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Elite enemies have a psychedelic aura, they are meaner and stronger than regular enemies.",
        "image": "images/folds5.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Once defeated they will drop a gold token. Collect these before they slide off the board to earn a reward at the end!",
        "image": "images/folds6.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Turn autoplay on and off to fast track to the end of the game.",
        "image": "images/autoplay.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      }
    ],
    "tableTitle": "How to Play",
    "spaceAfter": 30
  },

  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Watch out for your health! If this runs out, so do your chances of a reward..."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/folds7_HP.png",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 100,
    "spaceAfter": 1
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The Octoboss is your last adversary. Dodge the projectiles while using your weapons to overcome them. Octoboss will lose limbs as their health decreases."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/testGIF.gif",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 300,
    "spaceAfter": 1
  },

  {
    "type": "title",
    "text": "Experience Cards",
    "spaceAfter": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Keep an eye on your experience bar…"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/folds4_experienceBar.png",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 100,
    "spaceAfter": 0
