        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Use Paperwaves to deal damage to all enemies in its path!",
        "image": "images/folds11.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Increase your close combat defense with rotating Blade Sheilds.",
        "image": "images/folds12.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Double down on chance by harnessing the Wild Arrows, to shoot enemies in all directions.",
        "image": "images/folds13.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Call a Crane Storm to swarm your enemies and deal major damage.",
        "image": "images/folds14.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Collect and stack a variety of weapons in preparation for the final battle.",
        "image": "images/Combine.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      }
    ],
    "tableTitle": "",
    "spaceAfter": 30
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Invest in some health powerups, you will need your full strength to defeat the Octoboss!"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/folds15.png",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 200,
    "spaceAfter": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Numbers at the top of the cards indicate the level of the upgrade for already unlocked powerups."
      }
    ]
  },

  {
    "type": "table",
    "entries": [
      {
        "text": "There are only four opportunities to gather tokens. Each token represents one chance at a reward.",
        "image": "images/folds6.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "You can see the number of tokens collected at the top of the screen.",
        "image": "images/folds16_coinCollection.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "Collected tokens are rolled for a reward at the END of the game.",
        "image": "images/folds17.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      },
      {
        "text": "If you are unable to collect any tokens the play amount remains untouched and you will need to play again for another chance at a reward.",
        "image": "images/folds18.png",
        "maxImageHeight": 80,
        "imagePosition": "left",
        "imageHorizontalAlign": "right",
        "textHorizontalAlign": "left",
        "textVerticalAlign": "middle"
      }
    ],
    "tableTitle": "Tokens",
    "spaceAfter": 30
  },

  {
    "type": "title",
    "text": "Rewards",
    "spaceAfter": 5
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The reward for any collected tokens will be shown at the end of the game."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Each token is rolled separately, with the designated play amount being sunk a maximum of four times per game."
      }
    ]
  },

  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Play amount per token is selected before the game begins."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/folds19_playAmount.png",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 180,
    "spaceAfter": 0
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "Maximum play amount is also displayed to show how much you will be spending if you collect all four tokens."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "The play amount is not spent, and no rewards are given, until the end of the game."
      }
    ]
  },

  {
    "type": "flexContainer",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "value": "You will see how each token fares on the end screen, along with your total reward."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "image",
    "src": "images/EndScreen.png",
    "imagePosition": "center",
    "imageHorizontalAlign": "center",
    "imageHeight": 300,
    "spaceAfter": 0
